                                "sense_id": "908d1f17-9084-34c9-8c23-ef1231bcfb99",
                                "text": "He obeyed tractably enough, only turned toward her now and gazed at her with undissimulated intensity; not, though, as if speculating who she might be, rather as if wondering whether she were really there. \""
                            },
